- `auto`, range-for, structured bindings
- `enum class` for type-safe enums
- `constexpr` for compile-time computation
- `std::string_view`, `std::span` for non-owning views
- C++20/23: concepts, ranges, `std::format`, `std::print`, `std::expected`

